        "subject": "DRAFT LU-21180 lod: add kunit test for OST/OSS avoidance helpers",
        "message": "DRAFT LU-21180 lod: add kunit test for OST/OSS avoidance helpers\n\nAdd KUnit coverage for the OST/OSS avoidance helpers in lod_qos.c\nused while allocating a mirror (FLR) or EC component's stripes to\nspread them away from servers/targets already used by a conflicting\ncomponent in another mirror: lod_comp_is_ost_used(),\nlod_avoid_update(), lod_oss_avoid_some(), lod_oss_avoided(),\nlod_fdom_tgt_skip() and lod_should_avoid_ost().\n\nThese helpers were static; export them for the new test module and\nadd an entry-side canary assertion in lod_avoid_test_init() so that\nif the exit-side avoidance-array reset is ever broken, the next test\ncase fails loudly instead of silently inheriting a dangling pointer.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nAssisted-by: AGENT:claude-sonnet-5 [Augment Code]\nSigned-off-by: Ronnie Sahlberg <rsahlberg@whamcloud.com>\nChange-Id: I6271d5130f73d9584161d30bc6de6d5af0bcea26\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
